operational entry" was false for multi-row mutations, and that it lacked the
fully downstream-recomputed non-latest forge, independent fixed vectors,
cap-boundary partial recovery and archive/temp no-follow evidence required for
acceptance. The commands and results below remain immutable observations of
their old scope; none is current evidence for the present bytes.

