## Non-authoritative environment diagnostic

The global `python` executable collected 113 tests with 10 import/collection errors and 8 skips because PyQt6, psutil, sounddevice, Playwright, defusedxml/FastAPI-related dependencies were absent. This run is retained only as evidence that launching outside the project `.venv` is unsupported/incomplete. It must not be described as the latest or authoritative project test result.

## Status binding rule

A `WORKING_AND_VERIFIED` row in `CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md` must cite at least one `VE-*` record and narrow its claim to what that evidence exercises. Browser, live-provider, physical-device, LAN/mobile and native-release capabilities cannot inherit `VE-UNIT-001`; they remain limited, partial or blocked until their own proportional evidence passes.
